I need to pick up a package today.
It is on the other side of the city.
I look at my phone.
I open a public transport app.
I plan my route.
The route is long.
It has three parts.
First, I need to take a bus.
The bus drives to the metro.
Then I need to ride the metro.
Finally, I need to go to the harbour.
Here, I need to take the harbour bus.
The harbour bus is a large boat.
It sails on the water.
The package is in a small shop.
The shop is located close to the water.
It is a good plan.
I take my blue travel card.
I am ready for the trip.
